      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Normally unity won't allow you to import texture with size bigger than 8k square, bigger ones will be resized down to it.\n\nThat said, you are missing one important thing: Shaders have unlimited texture slots, so basically 1 Material could be enough to be problematic.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
