  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-09-06T01:02:14.796Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "42 Material slots of Actual IMG\nVS\n42 Material slots of 1x1 Pixel Color\n\n= Very Poor\n\nOr was it \n\n4 Material slots of 2~4MB IMGs\nVS 4 Material slots of 1x1 color pixels\n\nVery Good!\n\n\nto me ...\n1x1 pixel color 42 slots seems to loads faster than 4 2~4MB imges\n\n\nIf not then anyone could just use 3-4 material slots with some Gig Size img...just to load someone out of the world and walk away with a \" Very Good \" avatar -.-",
